e here to make sure that you can  come up with a project of your own  and of course you would have to give in  quite some time of yours  to be able to come up with a novel  project while  if you are also intending to go beyond  just a project and aim towards say  a poster presentation or even working on  a publication  which can be a very long drawn out  process so we definitely recommend  six months or more to be able to make  sure that that  project is ready to be presented to  everyone else so this is  again another one of the offerings that  are available for students  clinicians or researchers who are  interested in  attending a research program like this  and with this i would like to thank you  all for attending today's session and i  hope you enjoyed  this session and it was informative to  you and hope to see you in the upcoming  week  in the microbiome and metagenomic data  analysis program  thank you everyone  you
 

